{
  "name": "GRC evidence: Azure storage",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8f780c76-6acd-5821-b46f-96c1eb765368",
      "name": "Every day at 06:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ff309f3f-4397-5fae-b783-5dc22541f73f",
              "name": "subscription_id",
              "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "946df8a9-ae73-569f-a27d-98ae610807da",
              "name": "grc_url",
              "value": "https://grc.yourcompany.example",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1ae0a700-4cae-5116-8042-88b07fc89bde",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "EDIT THESE VALUES. grc_url is the address of your GRC platform.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://management.azure.com/subscriptions/{{ $('Settings').first().json.subscription_id }}/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts?api-version=2023-01-01",
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "responseContainsNextURL",
              "nextURL": "={{ $response.body.nextLink }}",
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !( $response.body.nextLink) }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api"
      },
      "id": "8c40e99b-5140-59f7-9059-11e95909de1d",
      "name": "Storage accounts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each input item is one page. Keep only the settings the checks test.\nconst sub = $('Settings').first().json.subscription_id, items = [];\nfor (const page of $input.all()) for (const a of (page.json.value || [])) { const p = a.properties || {};\n  // A missing allowBlobPublicAccess means the older default, which permitted public access.\n  items.push({ account: sub.slice(0, 8) + '/' + a.name, location: a.location, https_only: !!p.supportsHttpsTrafficOnly, public_blob_access: p.allowBlobPublicAccess !== false, minimum_tls: p.minimumTlsVersion || 'not set' }); }\nif (!items.length) throw new Error('Azure returned no storage accounts. Check the subscription ID and that the app has the Reader role.');\nreturn [{ json: { checks: ['azure_storage_https_only', 'azure_storage_no_public_access'], source_ref: 'Azure subscription ' + sub + ' (n8n)', collected_at: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 19), items } }];"
      },
      "id": "c9cf9c63-326e-5578-8d8a-3b788edc3a52",
      "name": "Shape accounts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.grc_url }}/api/integrations/collect",
        "options": {},
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
      },
      "id": "763ca63b-3e0a-51e2-a97e-55dbd657a3df",
      "name": "Send to GRC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GRC evidence: Azure storage\n1. Edit **Settings**. Use one copy of this workflow per subscription.\n2. On *Storage accounts* choose an **OAuth2 API** credential: Grant Type *Client Credentials*, Access Token URL `https://login.microsoftonline.com/<tenant-id>/oauth2/v2.0/token`, Scope `https://management.azure.com/.default`. Give the app registration the **Reader** role on the subscription and nothing else.\n3. On *Send to GRC* choose a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <GRC API token>`.\n4. Run once with **Execute workflow**, then switch it to Active.\n\nFeeds the checks `azure_storage_https_only` and `azure_storage_no_public_access`. Read-only.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "da108603-ce93-555a-8083-88637dcbad69",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -20
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every day at 06:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Storage accounts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Storage accounts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Shape accounts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Shape accounts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to GRC",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}